---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "Mortgage Broker Miami | FHA, Jumbo, Condo & Refinance Loans";
const description = "Work with a Miami mortgage broker to compare FHA, conventional, VA, jumbo, condo, refinance, DSCR, bank statement, and foreign national loan options.";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Miami mortgage broker</p><h1>Mortgage Broker in Miami</h1><p>Compare purchase, refinance, FHA, conventional, VA, jumbo, condo, DSCR, bank statement, and foreign national mortgage options with a Miami-focused approach.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Start Mortgage Review</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="get-preapproved-miami.html">Get Preapproved</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Calculate Payment</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span class="trust-pill">Matthew Gromadzki</span><span class="trust-pill">NMLS #2560919</span><span class="trust-pill">Miami · Florida</span></div></div><form class="lead-form"><h2>Start a Miami Mortgage Review</h2><p>Answer a few basics and we’ll review the best mortgage path for your scenario.</p><label>Loan goal<select><option>Select one</option><option>Buying a home</option><option>Refinancing</option><option>Condo financing</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Purchase price / value<input placeholder="$650,000"></label><label>Down payment / equity<input placeholder="$100,000"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Credit score range<select><option>Select range</option><option>760+</option><option>720–759</option><option>680–719</option><option>640–679</option></select></label><label>Property city<input placeholder="Miami"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Name<input></label><label>Phone<input></label></div><label>Email<input type="email"></label><button class="btn btn-primary full" type="button">Start Mortgage Review</button></form></div></section><section class="section "><div class="container two-col"><article class="prose"><p>Miami borrowers face unique mortgage decisions because the local market includes high-rise condos, waterfront homes, luxury properties, foreign national buyers, self-employed professionals, investors, and insurance-heavy underwriting scenarios.</p><div class="alert-box"><p><strong>Miami-specific issue:</strong> condo eligibility can matter as much as borrower approval. Insurance, litigation, reserves, budget, assessments, and rental rules can affect closing.</p></div><h2>Why Miami financing is different</h2><p>Brickell, Downtown Miami, Edgewater, Miami Beach, Aventura, Sunny Isles and Bal Harbour are condo and jumbo-heavy. Kendall, Doral, Homestead, Hialeah and Miami Gardens often bring more FHA, VA and first-time buyer questions. Coral Gables, Pinecrest, Coconut Grove and Key Biscayne often require jumbo and asset planning.</p><h2>What a good mortgage broker review includes</h2><ul class="check-grid"><li>Payment estimate</li><li>Cash-to-close estimate</li><li>Loan program comparison</li><li>Condo risk review</li><li>Rate and point discussion</li><li>Documentation checklist</li></ul></article><aside><div class="content-card"><h2>Core Miami mortgage pages</h2><ul><li><a href="fha-loan-miami.html">FHA Loans Miami</a></li><li><a href="conventional-loans-miami.html">Conventional Loans Miami</a></li><li><a href="jumbo-loans-miami.html">Jumbo Loans Miami</a></li><li><a href="condo-loans-miami.html">Condo Loans Miami</a></li><li><a href="bank-statement-loans-miami.html">Bank Statement Loans Miami</a></li><li><a href="dscr-loans-miami.html">DSCR Loans Miami</a></li></ul></div></aside></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>What does a Miami mortgage broker do?</summary><p>A broker compares loan options and helps with preapproval, documentation, property review, underwriting, and closing.</p></details><details><summary>Is a broker useful for Miami condos?</summary><p>Yes. Condo review can involve association documents, insurance, reserves, litigation, assessments, rental rules and project eligibility.</p></details><details><summary>Can I compare FHA, conventional and jumbo?</summary><p>Yes. The right option depends on credit, income, down payment, loan amount, property type, occupancy and goals.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="section "><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Keep comparing</p><h2>Related mortgage pages</h2><div class="card-grid small-grid"><a class="mini-card" href="get-preapproved-miami.html">Get Preapproved Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="miami-mortgage-rates.html">Miami Mortgage Rates<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Mortgage Calculator Florida<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="fha-loan-miami.html">FHA Loans Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="condo-loans-miami.html">Condo Loans Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="jumbo-loans-miami.html">Jumbo Loans Miami<span>→</span></a></div></div></section></main><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Mortgage guides</p><h2>Miami mortgage guides to help you plan</h2><p>Research FHA limits, condo financing, jumbo requirements, down payment assistance, first-time buyer steps, investor loans, and refinance comparisons.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="miami-mortgage-guides.html"><h3>All Miami Mortgage Guides</h3><p>Browse our full library of Miami mortgage guides.</p><span>Open guides →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="condo-financing-miami.html"><h3>Condo Financing Miami</h3><p>Review condo questionnaire, reserves, insurance, litigation, and non-warrantable condo issues.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="fha-loan-limits-miami-dade-county.html"><h3>FHA Loan Limits Miami-Dade</h3><p>Understand FHA loan limit planning and how it connects to purchase price and loan type.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
